From 4d43c505667fd0f0e621c3e539884c1d853d32f2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 5 Aug 2026 15:03:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Phase 3.3: Implement student learning features with
 localStorage

Add foundational learner personalization system supporting Continue Learning,
Bookmarks, Recently Viewed history, Per-section Progress Tracking, and Dashboard.

New components (all client-side minimal islands):
- RecordView: invisible tracker component that records lesson views
- BookmarkButton: toggleable bookmark button with visual state
- SectionProgress: per-section progress bar showing N of M lessons viewed
- ContinueLearningBanner: homepage banner showing last-visited lesson
- DashboardClient: unified dashboard displaying progress, bookmarks, quiz results

New backend:
- lib/learner-store.ts: localStorage-backed learner profile with useSyncExternalStore
  reactivity. Defines stable ContentRef keys (type:paper:section:slug) so future
  account migration won't break progress history. Recently-viewed capped at 12 items.

New server route:
- app/dashboard/page.tsx: precomputes section totals server-side to minimize client
  bundle (avoid importing full data/topics tree). Passes SectionTotal[] to client.

Bundle optimization:
- Dashboard route reduced from ~242kB to 109kB by moving data aggregation server-side
- All routes now consistently ~106-109kB (previously dashboard was 2.3x heavier)

Navigation:
- Added Dashboard link to primary nav
- Updated Header with LayoutDashboard icon and descriptions
- Updated site-config primaryNav list

Testing:
- All 61 unit tests pass
- All 38 e2e tests pass (including 13 dynamic-route 404 tests from Phase 3.1)
- Lint clean, no type errors

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
